   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Use the following information to answer questions 11 and 12.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Bank Account A starts with $5,000 and grows by $1,000 each week. </li>\n<li>Bank Account B starts with $1 and doubles each week</li>\n</ul>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"11\">\n  <li>Which account has more money after one week?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
